From 16b17e07860d280d45cd3f1f0e08f384399feaf3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 02:05:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 12/18] Never let git touch the vendored .lib files

The tree's .gitattributes starts with '* text=auto', which leaves git free to
decide; the WebView2 loaders are binary and must not be normalised.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .gitattributes | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.gitattributes b/.gitattributes
index 4c165cd..5cd62b4 100644
--- a/.gitattributes
+++ b/.gitattributes
@@ -7,3 +7,6 @@
 *.vcxproj.filters text eol=crlf
 
 cmake/ALL_BUILD.vcxproj.user.in text eol=crlf
+
+# Vendored binary libraries (WebView2 static loaders): never touch these.
+*.lib binary
-- 
2.54.0 (Apple Git-157)

